I0003 - Make REXX stage work with stream programs.
        * Implemented some post-S/370 instructions (LAE, STAM) Rexx requires
          to read stage-programs from streams.
I0002 - Make CMS stage work.
        * Forced CMS stage to take CMS 5.5 codepath and avoid assertion
          failure 1C8.
        * Implemented some post-S/370 instructions (AHI, BRC, BSM, CHI) CMS
          stage requires.
        * Requires unpublished dependency RAP016DS to capture console output.
I0001 - Cooperate with HRC100DS if installed.
I0004 - Automate builds and releases.
I0005 - Uplevel RexxUnit.
I0006 - Write README.md for GitHub and PLUNGER MEMO for CMS.
*
* Changes labeled "Cnnnn" below here were built on CMS and only added to
* git when each was complete, so the history may be a little odd.  See
* issues.memo for details of each one.
*
C0027 - REXX works.
C0026 - Error 58 running "TRD": File not found
